flowchart LR
    A[Canonical graph and batch ledger] --> B[Transaction: capture current version]
    B --> C[Validate registry, edges and degree]
    C --> D[Sparse symmetric normalization, float64]
    D --> E[Immutable model graph snapshot: COO, node map, manifest]
    E --> F[Export Parquet; publish manifest last]
    A --> G[Apply next batch: canonical version advances]
    G --> H[Freshness: current canonical version versus snapshot source version]
    E --> H
    H --> I[Explicit refresh produces a new snapshot]
